omada_webhook.description:
In the Omada controller: Settings → Services (or System) → Webhook → add a webhook:
URL: {url}
Shard Secret: {secret}
Then send the client events (connected / disconnected / roaming) and alerts to this webhook.

Any message makes Hotel Sense poll the controller at once, so rooms update within seconds. The controller must reach Home Assistant on the local network. Messages received so far: {received}.

